{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46210","headline":"山居诗二十四首 二十四 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 二十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"支公放鹤情相似，范泰论交趣不同。\n有念尽爲烦恼相，无私方称水晶宫。\n香焚薝卜诸峯晓，珠掐金刚万境空。\n若买山资言不及，恒河沙劫用无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46210.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46210","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}